        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump, brine-water, per kg</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump, brine-water, per kg
Inventory for the production of a brine-water heat pump, 7kW with a life time of 20 years.;
Synonyms: Wärmepumpe mit Wärmetauscher Sole/ Wasser 7kW; 
UUID: fc37580e-9c3e-3776-8232-6f673e5a3024
All material inputs for the heat pump and coolant, share of Infrastructure for the production of the heat pump and also the energy use for producing the heat pump. The Infrastructure for a borehole heat exchanger needs to be added if it is part of the system. Weight 158 kg.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology available on the market
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fc37580e-9c3e-3776-8232-6f673e5a3024.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
